# bad pattern
board/urls.go:6:12: route path "/x/{id" is not a valid pattern: at offset 7: bad wildcard segment (must end with '}')
  fix: see the patterns of net/http's ServeMux, such as /posts/{id}

# not from the root
board/urls.go:6:12: route path "x" does not start with /
  fix: write the path from the root, such as /posts/{id}

# root subtree
board/urls.go:6:12: route path "/" ends in /, so it would match every path below it
  fix: end it in {$} to match that path alone, such as /{$}

# subtree
board/urls.go:6:12: route path "/posts/" ends in /, so it would match every path below it
  fix: end it in {$} to match that path alone, such as /posts/{$}

